- tests/ + CI: offline pytest suite (retriever BM25, scorers, prompt builder)
- Dockerfile + .dockerignore, .env.example, LICENSE (MIT)
- README: git lfs pull step, weights note, requirements.txt, eval + Docker
- remove empty corpus.jsonl
